Construction of 38 road infrastructure in Siem Reap achieved 14.27%
(Phnom Penh): As of January 12, 2021, the construction of 38 roads in Siem Reap has reached 14.27%, which includes the completed work and materials sent to the construction site.
This is according to the content of the meeting to discuss the results of the implementation of 38 road infrastructure projects in Siem Reap City, Siem Reap Province, chaired by Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of National Defense and Chairman of the Inter-Ministerial Commission on the 13th. January 2021 at the Office of the Council of Ministers.
