Please note that the project to build infrastructure for 38 roads in Siem Reap is scheduled to take 13 months to complete, which is scheduled to be completed by the end of 2021. These 38 roads are divided into 4 types, including:
Type 3: A road that is not in a tourist area will be rebuilt with 20 cm thick reinforced concrete.
The 38 roads will be equipped with drainage, rainwater, sewage, flood protection systems, city flood prevention, sidewalks and street lighting poles, as well as other aspects such as: Cables, transmission systems, sidewalks, roads for the disabled, bike lanes, parking lots, traffic signs and markers, security camera systems, gardens and tree planting.
