(Pailin): Dr. O Vandin, Secretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of Health, urged the authorities and health officials of Pailin Province to pay more attention to prevent the spread of Kovid-19 disease.
This promotion was made on the occasion of Dr. O Vandin led a delegation from the Ministry of Health to meet with Ms. Ban Srey Mom, Governor of Pailin Province on January 12, 2021.
