Speaking at a press conference on the morning of January 13, 2021, Mr. Som Soreida stated that the NEC As an arbitrator for the election, the body does not take any political party as an enemy, but an official of the Coalition for Democracy, who accuses and insults the national institution. There is no exception, and the NEC Will take legal action as announced by the NEC in the past.
