The Deputy Secretary General added that on behalf of the NEC, he asked all relevant parties to continue to join the NEC in 2021 and next year to respect the rights of the electorate and Ensure no post-election instability by maintaining peace and development as a whole.
Mr. Som Soreida emphasized, "As noted by the NEC, the above lessons are not politically rich, but are lesson ideas for all parties to adhere to in order to build a country free from national hatred. "People, by taking each other dead and alive enemies that Cambodians have tasted for decades, do not forget this historical lesson."
