(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Municipal Authority has been constructing a new road in Tuol Kork district, where this new road was previously closed to traffic, but with the attention of Mr. Khuong Sreng, the governor of Phnom Penh, successfully opened this section of road to ease traffic congestion for the people.
