First, the Royal Government of Cambodia will give first priority to education and health after Cambodia benefits from the first drop of oil at the same time as the 22nd anniversary of Samdech Techo's win-win policy to end the war in Cambodia and Bring complete peace and complete national unity in the history of the whole nation for the past 22 years.
Second: Please continue to improve health and hygiene in the context of Kovid-19 by following the "3 prevent 3" approach, especially participation in preventing Kovid-19 infection in educational institutions on safety, health, education, maintenance of 1.5 meters. And food safety.
Fourth, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports must design and implement a curriculum, defining the obligations and elective subjects in the classroom and self-study to ensure that the students' learning is fully focused on the main points and depth. Lessons for ninth and twelfth grades and lesson assignments for diploma exams.
Fifth, the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports needs to review in accordance with the new context that requires more vitality and more to ensure the effectiveness of leadership and management of staff at all levels, including the management of teachers. Management of public finances in education and financing, cooperation, implementation of decentralization and deconcentration in education and regular capacity and professional development for administrators, principals and teachers.
Ninth: Children, students, young men and women, please continue to study hard and research consistently and actively participate in "good deeds" for growth in the family, society and our nation as a whole. At the same time, please always remember that if we love ourselves, love our parents and our society, we must stay away from drugs.
10th: All parents and guardians, please bring your children and grandchildren to enroll in school and continue to provide support, encouragement and additional teaching to children and grandchildren in all forms.
