He urged the leaders of the Royal Government, especially Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, who always thinks about education and human resource training.
Mr. Chea Oeung highlighted the progress of education from one generation to the next, making human resources more knowledgeable, and now there are roads, bridges, pagodas, schools, everywhere that children can easily access knowledge. He also thanked the teachers for their hard work, physical and mental strength to train students.
Mr. Chea Oeung brought materials to distribute to 35 teachers, each of them received a sarong, 50,000 Riels, and 73 graduate students, each of them received 20,000 Riels and a pen book. Also.
