In the opening message of the new school year, Samdech Techo Hun Sen expressed his great pleasure and would like to join with the Cambodian people, teachers, students and all students in all villages who have been preparing. To celebrate the opening of the new school year.
In this message, Samdech Techo Prime Minister expressed his sincere gratitude to the leaders at all levels, relevant ministries, institutions, local authorities, parents, guardians, benefactors, school management, especially teachers who overcame all obstacles to support. And provide all-round learning to students during the fight against Kovid-19.
Samdech Techo stated that although this year Cambodia as well as the whole world is fighting against Kovid 19 and there is no clarity regarding Kovid-19, however, the Royal Government of Cambodia still celebrates the opening ceremony of the school year. This important new 2020-2021 under the new concept is "a new life path in education".
With the opening of the New Year in the social situation still plagued by Kovid 19, Samdech Techo Hun Sen introduced 12 recommendations to the Ministry of Education and relevant authorities to implement to ensure the educational process. Better. These 12 guidelines and recommendations include:
Second: Please continue to improve health and hygiene in the context of Kovid-19 by following the "3 prevent 3" approach, especially the participation in preventing Kovid-19 infection in educational institutions, safety education, health education, maintenance of 1.5 meters. And food safety.
Twelfth: All public and private radio and television stations and other media, please continue to help spread the word about the campaign to recruit children and the importance of education, especially the production of educational programs and instructional videos to increase educational services. Reached everywhere, anytime, in line with the concept of lifelong education.
