Nepal is the fourth country in which Cambodia has provided mass and equipment for the fight against Kovid 19. In 2020, the Royal Government of Cambodia will provide mass and medical supplies to three countries. The Lao government has provided 2 million masks and medical equipment, the Myanmar government has provided 2 million masks and medical supplies, and the Timor-Leste government has donated 1.5 million masks and medical equipment.
The donation of medical equipment for the fight against Kovid 19 provided by the Royal Government of Cambodia to friendly countries is a demonstration of Cambodia's humanitarian gesture and a strong Cambodian spirit of participation in the fight against Kovid 19.
