Ministry of Education announces the opening of the 2020-2021 school year for public general education institutions on January 11
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports on January 08, 2021 issued a notification on the start of the implementation of the school year 2020-2021 on January 11, 2021 for public schools in accordance with the content of the letter. No. 1109, dated December 29, 2020 of the Office of the Council of Ministers. This is according to the announcement received by Fresh News.
In addition, the Ministry has issued guidelines on the implementation of curricula and study schedules for kindergartens, community kindergartens, primary schools and public secondary schools for the academic year 2020-2021, focusing on the preparation of students in the curriculum and Lessons and curriculum implementation.
In addition, in order to ensure the efficient and safe operation of public educational institutions in the context of Kovid-19, as well as to participate in the prevention and control of the spread of Kovid 19 during the school year and the run of the 2020-2021 school year, the Ministry issued a statement. Guidance on the implementation of educational safety measures in the school year 2020-2021 for public general education institutions.
