Mr. Vongsey Visoth chaired a meeting of the Inter-Ministerial Working Group on Negotiation and Consultation to Purchase Kovid-19 Vaccine
He added that Kovid-19 was closely related to the economy, which, if not properly controlled, would have a serious economic impact.
The inter-ministerial meeting discussed and consulted on procurement strategies and plans to purchase Kovid-19 vaccine to provide the Cambodian people quickly and expeditiously in line with Cambodia's needs, ensuring safety, quality and efficiency. Be consistent with the vaccination plan as well, because purchased vaccines can not be stored for too long.
