1: Work to restore family relationships, which covered the whole country 2: Protection of identity, promotion of the basic principles of international humanitarian law 3: Community safety and disability 4: Continue to monitor the progress of the implementation of the Safe Work Code 5 : Urgent work (Kovid-19)
