The congratulatory message of Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum reads as follows: Life, strength, mind, wisdom, spirit in fulfilling the historical mission to liberate the motherland, the people who are drowning in the dark regime, prisons without walls, even the right to life.
