Very symphonic! A boy ran across the road and was hit by a car in Svay Teap district, Svay Rieng province
(Svay Rieng): A boy ran across the road and was hit by a brick truck, the brakes did not hit and crushed completely, causing death on the spot.
This incident caused a surprise at 7:15 am on January 6, 2021 on Street 3130 in Prey Ta Theuk village, Koki Som commune, Svay Teap district, Svay Rieng province.
According to Svay Teap district police, the victim was a 6-year-old boy named Ny Thai, living in Prey Tathuk village, Koki Som commune, Svay Teap district, Svay Rieng province. The driver was not identified because after opening the door, the car escaped.
According to eyewitnesses, before the incident, the victim boy ran across the road from south to north carelessly, when a silver HYUNDAI brick truck with license plate Phnom Penh 3B-9419 was driving. In the direction from east to west to the scene, the brakes do not stick, hit the child, causing surprise.
Police said that after the incident, police arrived to record and hand over the body to the family for the traditional ceremony and drag the car to the Kokisom administrative checkpoint to wait for the legal settlement.
In this traffic accident, the police of Svay Teap district called on parents to be careful to take good care of their children and not to let their children run across the road, which could lead to accidents eventually.
Kandal Provincial Court Detains Rapist Who Killed a Teenage Girl in Takhmao City
Accused Touch Socheat was charged with rape and premeditated murder committed in a rented room on the night of January 5, 2021 at Prek Hoor Keut village, Prek Hoor commune, Takhmao city, Kandal province. This is according to Mr. Tin Sochetra, Deputy Prosecutor, told Fresh News on the evening of January 6, 2021.
It should be informed that this person acted to rape the victim named 18-year-old Pop Panh, a student at Hun Sen Takhmao High School, currently residing at the scene. Defendant Touch Socheat, 35 years old, also lived at the scene.
After the rape, the man escaped, but was recaptured by the police on the same day and interrogated at the Kandal Provincial Police for one night, and on the afternoon of January 6, the suspect was sent away. The court to punish according to the law.
Kandal provincial police chief Major General Chhoeun Socheth told Fresh News that the killer who stabbed the 18-year-old girl to death confessed to stabbing her to death in a pool of blood because he feared imprisonment. Because the victim threatened to tell her parents about her rape case seven days ago.
In this case, witnesses near the scene said that before the incident, the victim was staying in a room with a family of five, parents and two younger siblings. At 6 am on January 5, 2021, the parents went to work in the factory and the younger brother went to school.
Suddenly, at 7 am on the same day, the neighbors heard the screams and went to see the victim lying in a pool of blood in the room, saw many stab wounds, knives, and took the victim to the hospital. The doctor referred to the victory, but the victim was already dead.
It should be informed that at the beginning of 2021, there were many criminal cases in Kandal province, such as the case of free shooting, the case of shooting the staff in the head, the case of shooting and threatening the authorities in other cases, while the authorities under the leadership of Major General Chhoeun Socheat Hunting and cracking down on all targets.
