Minister Veng Sakhon encouraged companies to use more local raw materials by implementing agricultural production contracts to maximize the use of local raw materials to reduce exports.
Ministry of Mines announces the selection of companies for sand mining business in Koh Kong and Preah Sihanouk Provinces
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Mines and Energy has issued a notification on the recruitment of companies for sand mining business in Koh Kong and Sihanoukville provinces. This is according to the announcement received by Fresh News on January 5, 2021.
The Ministry of Mines has notified all local companies (including sole proprietorships) properly registered in the Kingdom of Cambodia that the Ministry will launch a public competition to select sand mining companies at the site. 7 locations, including 3 locations in Koh Kong province and 4 locations in Sihanoukville province, as shown in the map, location and standard attached below:
A company can accept applications from multiple locations, but companies that are affiliated with or have the same source can only accept competitive documents for one location.
