The hopes were expressed in a New Year's Eve Internet address to his ministry staff as North Korea plans to convene this week's Labor Party Congress for the first time in more than four years. North Korea is also expected to present economic plans and policy directions with the United States and South Korea.
During the upcoming party congress, North Korea is expected to unveil a new economic development plan for the next five years and also to present its new political stance with the United States and the United States. South Korea as well. North Korea has not yet confirmed a date, but observers have speculated that it could take place as early as this week or in the next few days.
