For further work, Mr. Steng Sokhom urged the officials of the Royal Government Working Group to be active in going to the grassroots because with only one year left, it is time for the Commune / Sangkat Council elections.
He also encouraged all working groups to continue to hold public forums to grasp the requests and suggestions of the people. At the same time, the village and commune administrations must continue to provide good public services to the people.
