(Kandal): A young man drove a car into a light pole and tried to free himself by firing several AK rifles of the police, causing a great surprise on January 2, 2021, yesterday in Kampong Thkol village, commune Sampov Poun, Koh Thom District, Kandal Province. However, the young man could not escape under the lightning operation led by the young Kandal Provincial Commissioner, Major General Chhoeun Socheat, chased and arrested him back the same night.
At around 1:50 pm on January 2, 2021, a 27-year-old man named Pov Hong from the Saang District Police Inspectorate described a traffic accident that turned into a shooting scene like this movie. Driven a large truck in the direction from south to north. Arriving in front of the Sampov Poun police station, the steering wheel hit three light poles and cut the power line about 60 meters.
After that, the police station stopped the car and the perpetrator and left it at the police station waiting for the owner of the car to come in and fix the light pole and turn on the light. When the owner of the car, Kong Chiep Leng, a 40-year-old man, arrived at the Sampov Poun police station at around 2:40 pm, he met with the police. Under the mediation, the car owner agreed to help find a mechanic to repair the poles and re-connect the wires.
Saang district police said that at around 5 pm, when the mechanic was reconnecting the power line, people came to file a complaint to lose their ID card and make a residence permit. At that time, the police officer locked the door of the filing room to fill out the application form for the people.
After seeing that, both the police officer and the car owner comforted the young man to come out. But the young man refused to come out as requested. Seeing this, the police officer reported to the Koh Thom District Inspector for further action.
At around 7:28 pm, the suspect took a gun and fired three shots at the police. At the same time, Major General Chhoeun Socheat, Kandal Provincial Police Commissioner, led a joint force of the commission to the scene.
After firing three shots, the suspect fired four more shots in a row.
After seeing that the suspect refused to surrender in comfort and kept firing threats at the police, the police force, led by the brave young commissioner, used all professional measures to reach the smoke bomb. In the room and broke through the door to arrest this young man.
The operation to arrest the young man, who was found to have drugs in his body, took more than five hours, from 5 pm to 10:10 pm. After the arrest, the suspect was sent to the provincial office for further legal action. Boeung Keng Kang District Governor Leads Experts to Inspect Road Construction in Sangkat Boeung Keng Kang III
