This is Cambodia's first bilateral trade agreement that has a high level of openness, scope and importance in promoting community building, a common destiny between the two countries, as well as economic and social development in Cambodia.
Negotiations on a free trade agreement between China and Cambodia were launched in late 2019, but only half a year reached a joint agreement, highlighting the high level of comprehensive strategic partnership between the two countries.
