On the occasion of the New Year 2021, Chinese President Xi Jinping sent a message of congratulations on the Global New Year 2021 from Beijing with the following contents:
Hello ladies and gentlemen:
The step of 2021 is approaching, I wish you a Happy New Year, a Global New Year to all of you from Beijing! 2020 is a very unusual year. In the face of the epidemic of 19 epidemics of Kovid, we have interpreted the great love of man by putting people first and life first, and recorded the history of the fight against communicable diseases. Solidarity and perseverance.
Each person who persevered, took turns to do the work again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again and again. Great stories come from ordinary stories, heroes come from the people.
Everyone is amazing! I would like to greet all 19 Kovid infected people and pay my respects to all ordinary heroes! I am proud of our motherland and our great people and proud of the spirit of a nation that has worked so hard!
At the historic crossroads of the goal of "Two 100 Years", the new process of building a modern socialist country from all angles is about to begin. The future development process is far away, only hard work can be achieved. We have achieved a lot through hard work and we will continue to overcome the obstacles ahead to create more brilliance.
In the meantime, all the families are happily reunited. The new year is approaching and I wish the country a beautiful and peaceful! I wish the people happiness and good health!
