Interior Ministry Spokesman: 68 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses
(Phnom Penh): At least 68 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on December 30, 2020 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News this morning, December 31.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 68 suspects, 11 were arrested in seven criminal cases and 57 were arrested in 23 drug cases.
