(Phnom Penh): To facilitate the daily life of two Jabi Dang Veng elders, eloquent elders Kong Nai and Tanet Pe, who are getting healthier, Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit have assigned a humanitarian team to lead Gifts to the two elders.
On the morning of December 30, 2020, Mr. Chin Bunthoeun led the team to take the annual donation to give to the eloquent elder Kong Nai, now 75 years old, living in Doung Village, Svay Tong Khang Cheung Commune, Kampong Trach District, Kampot Province.
In the afternoon of the same day, the team continued to bring the gifts of the two Samdechs to hand over to Mr. Tanet Pe, the famous elder Chapey Dang Veng, 64 years old, living in Srah Keo village, Kraing Svay commune, Preah Sdach district, Prey Veng province.
The donations to be given to the two elders include: a large set of food and household items and a budget of $ 1,200 as an annual stipend from 2007 to the present.
The elder expressed his great excitement and gratitude to the two princes who always take care of their difficulties and the people everywhere.
