(Kratie): Vattanac Bank inaugurated its 24th branch in Kratie province on December 30, 2020, after inaugurating its 23rd branch in Kampong Chhnang province on December 26, 2020. .
Vattanac Bank Kratie Branch is located at No. 121, Sihanoukville, Kratie City, Kratie Province (about 70 meters beyond the Kratie bus stop on the right). Vattanac Bank Kratie Branch has high-rise luxury buildings with modern style, with a comfortable service hall and a large parking lot for customers to operate.
Vattanac Bank Kratie Branch is ready to provide excellent banking services with high professional standards on all types of financial services, including deposit services, credit services, mobile banking, internet banking, money transfer services. Business Finance Services, Card Services (Visa, MasterCard and UnionPay). In addition, the new branch also provides all kinds of tax payment services more easily and quickly.
At the inauguration ceremony, Duke Chhun Leang, Editor-in-Chief of Vattanac Bank, said, “The inauguration of the Kratie branch today is another important historical event for Vattanac Bank. Vattanac Bank Kratie Branch will provide many financial services to business people and the general population in Kratie and contribute to the economic growth of the province.
Neak Oknha continued, “Kratie branch will provide all kinds of commercial banking services to customers. Therefore, all business people and the general public in Kratie Province, please come and discuss banking services with Vattanac Bank to expand the business and try to use Vattanac Bank Mobile Banking, which will provide a secure and convenient banking experience. .
Neak Oknha further stated that in order to celebrate the opening of Kratie branch, Vattanac Bank will provide customers with a special program, providing free Visa Debit Cards to all customers who open savings and accounts. Current with Vattanac Bank, Kratie Branch.
