(Phnom Penh): At least 42 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on December 29, 2020 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News this morning, December 30.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 42 suspects, 23 were arrested in seven criminal cases and 19 were arrested in 12 drug cases.
Ministry of Water Resources: From December 31 to January 3, the weather will be very cold again, please people take care of their health!
(Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Water Resources and Meteorology has issued a weekly press release on the weather situation in Cambodia from December 30 to January 5, 2020.
The ministry confirmed that the Kingdom of Cambodia will be affected by the high pressure of China moving down and the northeast monsoon. This situation will cause the weather to cool down again from December 31 to January 3:
At the same time, the Ministry calls on the people, especially the heroes of the army and police, to stand in the Dangrek Mountains and the northeastern plateau to take care of their health. Especially for fishermen and seafarers, be careful of strong winds and high waves.
