The expression of joy and pride of this famous business came after Samdech Techo Hun Sen on December 29, 2020 announced the good news and pride for the people of Cambodia from the start of the first drop of oil. From waiting for many years.
In addition, Tycoon Lim Heng said that what is important when we get oil is another new income from our resources and will increase jobs, increase the infrastructure that serves this oil, as well as transportation. Also shipped.
Regarding the fact that Cambodia has this oil, Mr. Oknha said, "It is one thing to maintain the stability of our country's energy security, that we have oil that is not completely dependent on imports, which makes people expect that there will be no shortage of fuel, as well as keeping prices. To be cheaper for consumers in our country.
Tycoon Lim Heng added, "This is the pride of our country, which hopes to have its own oil and hopes that the price of oil will be cheaper to use, reduce transportation costs, which will support production in the export industry. Other.
At the same time, Tycoon Lim Heng also emphasized that the peace factor and the policy factor of the Royal Government are the factors that make various sectors in Cambodia as prosperous as today, which enables local businesses as well as foreign investors to do business. In Cambodia.
Oknha Dr. Kim Heang, a well-known real estate businessman in Cambodia, also expressed his happiness and admiration for the news of Cambodia's first drop of oil.
He said that the acquisition of oil will help Cambodia get more revenue in addition to existing revenue from other sectors such as exports.
In addition, he believes that Cambodia, after becoming one of the world's largest oil producers, will have good oil prices and will help secure the energy that Cambodia used to import from abroad.
Regarding Samdech Techo Hun Sen's decision to use the money from the revenue from oil pumping on two priorities, namely education and health, he expressed his support for this right and long-term decision. .
He believes that now the world has entered the digital age, so the development of human resources is necessary for Cambodia, the Royal Government sees investment in education. The health sector, on the other hand, is essential because everyone needs health first. Investing in the health sector not only promotes health promotion, but also helps prevent people from going abroad for health care.
"I am very pleased and proud of the Royal Government of Cambodia for ending the flames of war through Samdech Techo's win-win policy for the past 22 years. "This victory has led to Cambodia's security and development, as well as attracting foreign investment, such as investment in oil exploration, until Cambodia gets its first drop of oil now."
For Mr. Oknha Song Saran, President of the Cambodian Rice Federation, said that as a Cambodian citizen and an entrepreneur in the agricultural sector, he is very happy that Cambodia has received a historic drop of oil.
"I am just happy and celebrating this historic day," he said. I believe that Cambodia is a small country, but under the eyes of the international community when our oil drops start production. "I really admire the leadership of the Prime Minister, who is talented in leading a nation that is turning towards the oil sector."
