(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, this morning, December 29, 2020, delivered a special message from his home in Takhmao City, live on Cambodian National Television and live on various media in the country. Cambodia as well.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a special message for almost 3 hours to the Cambodian people regarding the closing of the community event on 28 November, the 22nd anniversary of Cambodia's win-win politics and the first drop of Cambodia's oil, below are the main messages of Samdech Techo:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces the closing of the community event on November 28 on December 29, 2020
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen praises the Ministry of Health, medical officers, the armed forces and the people who participated in preventing Kovid 19 and ending the community event on 28 November
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen Thanks to the Partners of the World Health Organization for Contributing to the Prevention of Community Events November 28
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that since December 20, until now, there have been no Cambodian workers who brought the 19 19 outbreak of Kovid disease in Thailand into Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked Mr. Prayuth Chan Ocha and the government for taking care of Cambodian workers in Thailand, which shows the good relations between the two countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen once again commended the Ministry of Health, the Ministry of National Defense, and the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces for providing vehicles for the transport of workers to perform rituals.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on Cambodian workers working in Thailand to continue living in Thailand and avoid moving from one place to another
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had received a letter from Prayuth Chan Ocha asking for help to prevent Cambodian workers from entering Thailand during the 19 outbreak of Kovid, and he had already called for this.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that through the community event on 28 November, we were fighting three battles, including the first: import, the second: the community infection that just passed on 28 November and the third: Healing
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that we do not prevent foreigners or British nationals from entering Cambodia, but we must properly control the transgression.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reminded that in the past, Cambodia was ranked No. 1 in Asia and No. 3 in the world in preventing Kovid 19, but now Cambodia is ranked No. 1 in the world in preventing Kovid 19.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that despite the good rankings, we must not rejoice because the 19 problems of the world are not over yet.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says doctors who enter the new framework must dare to fight Kovid 19
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that now we need to have some measures to be taken, including 3 protections and 3 do not
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech had discussed with the Ministry of Health and Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng by setting a standard distance of 1.5 meters to prevent 19 Kovid in Cambodia instead of limiting the number of people gathered.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that now in Cambodia, it is possible to gather a lot, depending on the location, as long as the distance is kept according to the safety standard, taking 1.5 meters as a base
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says learning online may be less effective
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen decided to take January 11, 2021 as the opening day of the school year
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that some bad people accused Samdech of damaging the education system when it was decided to automatically bankrupt 12th grade students, but Samdech must consider the safety of students as a top priority
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen tells all students to recognize the faces of those who come out against them due to the automatic decision to go bankrupt
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if Hun Sen was stupid, he could not lead the country from empty hands until now, he could not lead the overthrow, he could not negotiate to end the war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that any unnecessary meetings, such as state meetings, can continue online
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen Urges Owners of Hotels, Restaurants and Tourist Service Centers to Take Measures to Prevent Kovid 19 and Give Authorities the Right to Shut Down If Safety Measures Are Not Implemented
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reappears in defense of Mr. Chhem Savuth and his family because they are victims of Kovid 19
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges the authorities to check new entrants in their locality and to arrange for them to do so if they come from abroad without doing the right thing.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls for joint prevention of community contagion again after the closing of the community event on 28 November
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces the good news of Cambodia today, the first drop of Cambodian oil that has started
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen recalled the words of King Norodom Sihanouk that Samdech was a smart Cambodian
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen Reminds of Changing Lives Two Decades to Bring Peace to the Cambodian People
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian war, which began in 1970, was finally ended under a 1998 win-win policy.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says the end of the war in Cambodia counts from the day the Khmer Rouge supreme leader came to negotiate with the prince at home
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that during negotiations at Samdech's house in 1998, Samdech donated $ 10,000 to a family of Khmer Rouge leaders
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reprimands Chan Yet, president of a political party, to stay away from land issues in Chhong Ruk village and fraud
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen tells Senior Minister Om Yentieng to find all the documents if Mr. Chan Yet does not withdraw from the land issue and defraud others must be arrested immediately
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that we have to wait for 30 years to find Cambodia's first oil like now
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announced that as of 5 pm yesterday, Cambodia has 13 trillion riels in the National Bank, while the reserve is more than 2 billion riels, including 44 tons of 400 kilograms of gold as Samdech's legacy Norodom Sihanouk in Switzerland 12 tons 300 kg deposited at the Bank of England 17 tons 15 tons at the National Bank of Cambodia
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that as of the end of November 2020, Cambodia's trade volume was more than 30 billion US dollars, of which Cambodia exported 15 billion US dollars, despite Kovid 19, but Cambodia's exports increased.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says the Hun Sen government does not have a penny to spend on oil, but the Hun Sen government can still survive
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces again that Samdech will continue to hold office until he is 78 years old, another 10 years
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reiterates that Deputy Prime Minister Aun Porn Moniroth is one of the candidates for the post of Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen says that the more you criticize me, the more you will continue to hold office
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that now the group that wants to overthrow Samdech is trying to negotiate, but Samdech Prakas does not negotiate with, must implement the law
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that Cambodia's offshore oil fields do not overlap with Thailand
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen considered Cambodia's first drop of oil as a blessing to the Cambodian nation. The money raised will be used in two priority areas: education and health.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirms that after Samdech is gone, Samdech Tea Banh is a key figure in win-win politics
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces continued support for workers who lost their jobs during Kovid 19 for another 3 months, with the government providing $ 40 and factory owners paying $ 30 per person per month
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that Cambodia is preparing to provide three anti-Kovid 19 masks and medical equipment to Nepal, a difficult country
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that as of 2 pm yesterday, the Royal Government has received $ 53,679,714 and 9,935,488,500 Riels from philanthropists to purchase 19 vaccines against Kovid, including the King.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanks the King and Samdech Mey for donating money to buy vaccines, as well as thanking the philanthropists who participated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are three gateways for purchasing Kovid 19 vaccine to Cambodia, including through Kovak, the second through international relations and the third through direct negotiations with the company.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia has to wait until it is specifically recognized by the World Health Organization to be able to order the vaccine because we can not take the Cambodian people to test the vaccine
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacts to commentators that Samdech wants to skip China's vaccine
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen states that if the Chinese vaccine is recognized by the World Health Organization, it will be even better because China is close to Cambodia
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen warns those who insult the wife and children of Samdech as the children and wives of the Vietnamese leader
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen is willing to cut off his own hand if he does not tolerate those who insult his son and wife as the children and wife of the Vietnamese leader
