"Win-win politics is a believable realist politics that has brought about a complete and lasting peace, and this peace will definitely last for a long time with the confidence of the whole society in Participating in the maintenance of this precious peace, as well as participating in all other major national movements under the wise leadership of Samdech Techo Prime Minister, the beloved of the Khmer nation.
