The victim's family expressed his deep gratitude to the prosecutor and all the benefactors for their generous donations of food and money to the bereaved family. The family also thanked Dr. Oun Chhengly, who on the morning of December 27, 2020, went to check and treat.
Mr. Oun Chhengly, a doctor in Kampong Chhnang city, said that after measuring the victim's blood, the victim had more than 15 out of 85 blood pressure. With this, the doctor also gave the medicine to be taken for 15 days.
