The distribution of Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng's rice distribution to the poor people in 108 villages took place this morning, December 26, 2020, at four different locations:
* At the first location at the CPP headquarters in Ba Phnom district, Mr. Prum Sokha, Minister of Public Works, District Working Group Chairman, led the distribution team to 489 families from Chheu Karch, Cheung Phnom and Rong Damrey communes.
* Second location in villages in Speu commune (b) Mr. Ros Varun, Undersecretary of State of the Ministry of Interior, Deputy Chairman of the District Working Group and Chairman of the Commune Working Group, led the distribution of rice to 193 poor families in the commune.
* At the third location at the Boeung Preah commune party office, Mr. Iv Leang, Secretary General of the Ministry of Interior, Deputy Chairman of the District Working Group and Chairman of the Commune Working Group, led the distribution of rice to 284 poor families in the commune.
* Location 4: Led by Mr. Hourn Chankakkada, Deputy Secretary General of the Ministry of Interior and Chairman of the Commune Working Group, Mr. Suon Raksmey, Director of the Internal Audit Department of the Ministry of Public Works, and Mr. Nhem Sok, Director of the Prey Veng Provincial Department of Public Works, Deputy Chairman of the Sdao Kong Commune Working Group. Distributed rice to 205 poor families in the commune.
In total, each poor family received 25 kg of rice, and some places also distributed Yale alcohol, hand wash and some masks.
