On that occasion, people with disabilities who received gifts expressed their gratitude and gratitude to Samdech Techo Hun Sen of Cambodia for giving precious gifts and always giving attention to people with disabilities in the past.
Secretary of State for Social Affairs Em Chanmakara said, "Although this year the Royal Government of Cambodia has not organized a Day of Persons with Disabilities, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen have not forgotten. Dispose of people with disabilities by continuing to provide gifts and assign officers to visit people with disabilities directly.
