(Pursat): Mr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Pursat Province, this morning, December 24, 2020, continued to use and fulfill his role as a servant of the people by striving to mediate and resolve all conflicts as well as challenges that arise in life. Live daily at the forum in the provincial hall.
Coordinating through the above public forum was attended by members of the Provincial Council, the Deputy Governor, the Deputy Chief of the People's Office, the District / Municipality Authority, Commune / Sangkat, the Secretariat and other stakeholders.
