Mr. Mao Thunin continued that the mechanism that he was working on was the mechanism of the Royal Government through public forums that pointed out to the provincial and local levels to connect directly with the people on the challenges and needs in life. Daily.
He always uses two hierarchies: first, as the provincial governor, to facilitate the legal challenges of parents and citizens, and second, as a family, as a brother, a sister, a niece, and a nephew. A grandson in a family of more than 500,000 people across the province to mourn with them at all times.
