Especially at O'Bei Choan checkpoint, in O'Bei Choan commune, O'Chrov district, Banteay Meanchey province, in order to put in place additional measures to strengthen the management of the people who have returned from Thailand very strictly by checking the temperature and sending them to the city hospital. Poipet to do 14 days of proper meditation according to the measures of the Ministry of Health.
