According to the official, the people who left Thailand after the inspection were sent to the sampling and testing facilities for 14 days in 4 places that the provincial and municipal authorities have already prepared, including the first: at the department Poipet Referral Doctor (New Land), 2nd: Poipet Health Center 1, 3rd: Prohm Nimit School and 4th: Nimit Thmey High School.
