Through a telephone interview, Dr. Sok Sokretya informed the Thai press about Samdech Techo's special message and the announcement of his measures regarding the situation and outbreak of Kovid-19 infection in Thailand.
This Thai news website quoted Samdech Techo as saying that not leaving Thailand is to protect oneself from infection and to avoid losing one's job. In particular, avoid importing disease to Cambodia in case of possible disease.
The website advertises that "Samdech Chatcho calls on parents, families, spouses or children who have relatives working in Thailand to encourage the children, spouses and relatives who are working there to continue to work hard to keep Get our jobs there. ”
