A farmer in Banlung City, Ratanakkiri Province, planting mixed crops on 11 hectares of land is enjoying a harvest with a reasonable market
(Ratanakkiri): The owner of an 11-hectare orchard in Thmor Da village, Boeung Kanseng commune, Banlung city, Ratanakkiri province, expressed his happiness after his crops were very productive and reasonably priced in the market. Well.
