(Phnom Penh): Four important draft laws were fully approved by the Senate in the 6th session of the 4th legislature of the Senate, which was held this morning, December 21, 2020. The session was chaired by Samdech Vibol Sena Pheakdey Say Chhum, President of the Senate.
The Senate statement, obtained by Fresh News, states that the four draft laws include: the draft law on finance for management in 2021, the draft law on the payment of the general state budget for management in 2019, Draft Law on Securities and Draft Law on the Organization and Functioning of the Non-Banking Financial Services Authority.
There were 57 senators who participated in approving these draft laws, including defending the draft law by a representative of the Royal Government, Dr. Aun Porn Moniroth, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Economy. And finance, accompanied by leaders, senior officials and professional officers.
After approving these four draft laws, the Senate will resume its sixth session of the fourth legislature at 8:00 am on December 22, 2020 to review and comment on a number of other draft laws. Agenda of the 6th session.
