On that occasion, the Thai side proposed a budget of more than 50 million baht to build a commercial road connecting Tha Sen, Moeung district, Trat province, Thailand, to Thmor Da (National Road 55), Veal Veng district, Pursat province. Cambodia, as of now, has been building 90% and will be completed before the planned contract.
