She stated that through this work, she misses Cambodia and the Cambodian people when they finish their work from Cambodia.
"At this point, I began to miss Cambodia because of Cambodia, friends or acquaintances who have always been close to me," she said.
She also apologized for not meeting directly with those who had been in contact to say goodbye due to the current condition of Kovid 19. She hopes to have the opportunity to come to Cambodia and meet again.
