Kampot provincial governor added, "Even if the people go to the above leaders to intervene, but those problems must be returned to the provincial administration to solve again, because Samdech Techo has long recommended that concerns "Where there is a land dispute, the administration is the one who solves it."
On behalf of the entire provincial administration, Mr. Chiao Tai was pleased to welcome and look forward to resolving all issues and concerns to the people impartially and transparently.
In fact, after listening to the issues and requests of the people's representatives who have land issues with So Nguon, India and First Biotech, the provincial governor accepted all the requests raised. At that time, and set up a working group to inspect the farmland that the people are actually occupying to request to the Royal Government to cut the registration circle for the people.
