The operation was led by Mr. Has Sareth, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, Mr. Eng Chea San, Government Delegate in charge of Fisheries Administration and Mr. Khun Savoeun, Undersecretary of State, Ministry of Agriculture.
