Interior Ministry Spokesman: 54 people arrested for criminal and drug offenses
(Phnom Penh): At least 54 suspects were arrested in criminal and drug offenses across Cambodia on December 17, 2020 yesterday. This was confirmed by General Khieu Sopheak, spokesman for the Ministry of Interior, to Fresh News this morning, December 18.
General Khieu Sopheak added that of the 54 suspects, 13 were arrested in 12 criminal cases and 41 were arrested in 17 drug cases.
