Mr. Thou Phea said that the purpose of this meeting is to strengthen the management and accountability of the official Facebook page of the organization to jointly follow important information and share more actively, especially together. Follow all the requests of the people who express their opinions by sending messages and logging in to the official Facebook page of each unit and respond to, explain and solve problems for the people in a timely manner.
The Deputy Governor stated that on the other hand, the official Facebook page of each unit must support and disseminate all important information of the Royal Government at both the national and sub-national levels, which strives to build the nation's development in all areas, including providing Services and consideration for the well-being of the people in all circumstances, all over the country, under the shadow of peace, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
