The ring road will be 27 meters wide for downtown and 25 meters wide for downtown. It will have street lights for city streets and ornamental trees for suburban roads.
The third ring road will have four flyovers (crossing National Roads 4, 3, 2 and 21) with a total length of 1,000 meters. Two bridges were built across the Bassac River at Anlong Chen Island with a total length of 996 meters (of which the East Bassac Bridge is 630 meters long and the West Bassac Bridge is 366 meters long). Construction of 6 medium and short bridges and 113 sewers of all kinds.
