The National Assembly informs the leadership, members and officials of the General Secretariat to return to work after the 19 Kovid test is completed
(Phnom Penh): The General Secretariat of the National Assembly has informed all leaders, members and officials of the General Secretariat to return to normal work after the results of the 19 Kovid tests were completed. That negative. This is according to the announcement of the General Secretariat of the National Assembly on December 14, 2020, which was received by Fresh News.
The announcement states that after the announcement of the Ministry of Health on the results of the third test of the community event on 28 November, which has already received negative results and to participate in preventing the spread of Kovid-19 disease, the General Secretariat of the National Assembly The following requests were made:
1: Samdech and those who have taken the test 3 times and have been doing the test for 14 days can come to work normally without the fourth test.
