Establishment of these technical teams to ensure efficiency and high quality in the construction of 38 road infrastructure in Siem Reap.
Senior Minister Sun Chanthol personally studied and proposed the construction of 38 roads in Siem Reap to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia. The Senior Minister was also directly assigned by Samdech Techo to lead the implementation of this construction work.
As the Prime Minister in charge of the construction of the historic road in the territory of the Angkorian Empire, bringing the quality and aesthetics of the road as studied has been a vital task for Senior Minister Sun Chanthol.
During the inspection of road construction this morning, Senior Minister Sun Chanthol also instructed the road construction team to put up a billboard confirming the project owner and the standard builder so that the people and stakeholders know and maintain order. How to avoid and facilitate traffic from congestion, wear appropriate uniforms and use safety technical equipment consistently during construction.
