(Foreign): Banknotes are currently the most popular currency for payments for goods and products, while banking payments are also in full swing in some countries. Do you know which country made the first banknote?
Chinese people use this banknote to buy goods and buy farmland that can be borrowed back and forth. However, the above banknotes are not as widely used as they are today, they are mostly used in areas where there is less gold and silver (metal) for spending.
