Minister Veng Sakhon Joins Honorary Co-Chair of the 4th Asia-Europe International Agriculture Fair via Video
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, on December 14, 2020, at the office of the Ministry of Agriculture, participated in the opening ceremony of the 1st Asia-Europe International Agriculture Workshop and Exhibition. 4 committed via video system.
During the ceremony, Minister Veng Sakhon, on behalf of the Royal Government of Cambodia, expressed his deep gratitude to the Government of the People's Republic of China through the Belt and Road Policy for making rapid progress in the construction of key infrastructure such as: Roads, bridges, hospitals, irrigation, agriculture, and especially Chinese investors to invest in Cambodia.
