The global spread of Kovid-19 has had a devastating effect on the global economy, including Cambodia, and in order to support the economy and food security for the Cambodian people, the Royal Government has taken effective measures. And timely, including the promotion of local agricultural production by encouraging and providing low-interest loans to farmers and small and medium enterprises.
