Khmer Civilization Expert: What is the real cause of the increase in Kovid-19 infection in the world?
In this context, it is observed that each country infected with the growing virus has made great efforts, but the virus is still spreading fiercely. At the same time, the world is wondering why some countries are growing so much, others are growing so little, and some are almost non-existent. At this point, in order to inform the experts of Khmer civilization, please bring some countries to show and explain as follows:
At this point, because the chapter on the increase or decrease of each country, as shown above, has a similar plan, so we would like to consider only a few countries, such as the United States, France, Britain, Russia, China and Cambodia. Examine each country from its inception to the present:
Although Russia, France, Britain and Italy have risen in two stages, one high and one hundred low, but the second wave has risen again to this day. This case is very similar to the United States is a real increase.
In this context, according to the above statistics, we can see that those countries have been infected with the virus in two or three cases, except for China, which has started in large numbers. We can assume that it is the first wave.
In the third wave, now, after these countries have a series of festivals, the number of infections has increased from 200,000 to 250,000 per day without stopping because people are not careful to take care of themselves and break the safety barrier. Will: Abuse to walk freely, without fear, not only infect yourself but also bring the virus to your family!
Given the challenges of this shocking and horrific event, a large number of countries, including leaders and citizens, have enacted laws to combat this deadly infection. Obviously, the level of transmission of Kovid-19 virus has remained low.
In Cambodia, in this service, the head of the Royal Government has taken the most drastic measures to prevent this deadly virus, the actual result in Cambodia is just over 300 cases. And the other patient was almost completely healed. This action has made the World Health Organization appreciate and consider Cambodia as a "model country".
