The program took place with a ribbon-cutting ceremony by Mr. Lim Chea Vutha and unit leaders. After that, there was a refreshing meal with the staff to celebrate the presence of its new office building, paying attention to the rules of the Ministry of Health to prevent the transmission of Kovid 19.
Entering this glamorous new office, employees who used to live in a small apartment building have all been happy and satisfied with their new workplace.
The desire and desire to see the presence of one's own building stand out as the deepest aspirations of the co-founders Lim Chea Vutha and Kim Meng, as well as the chief of staff and all the staff working under the unit's shadow. The co-founders of the locomotive and the staff all put a big smile on their faces as an expression of their heartfelt joy for this new achievement, their greatest aspiration.
The young founder and CEO told staff that the presence of Fresh News's building was a great new achievement for the unit, born of the hardest and most energetic efforts of the management and staff. Go through countless difficulties and obstacles.
"From today, we have a warm support, which is the property of all of us," he said. This building is the result of our hard work. We will continue to walk together, move forward together and succeed together. "I could not have had this day without the participation of all of you."
Mr. Lim Chea Vutha also took the opportunity to inaugurate his new office building, thanking all the business owners who co-sponsored the broadcast of all media of Fresh News. He noted that the sponsorship and co-operation of the owners of these companies and businesses is a strong support for the operation and step of Fresh News.
