A man shot himself in the abdomen and seriously injured in Khemarak Phoumin City, Koh Kong Province.
(Koh Kong): Police in Khemarak Phoumin Municipality, Koh Kong Province, arrested a man after he shot himself in the abdomen because of a love triangle at 12 o'clock on December 11, 2020 in Village 2, Sangkat Dang Tong, Khemarak Phoumin City, Koh Kong Province.
According to the police report, the victim, Nget Say, male, 55 years old, resided in the above commune (widow), while the suspect, Som Saroeun, male, 57 years old, and his wife Phan Sokhon, 49, lived at the market. Chas, Sangkat Dang Tong, Khemarak Phoumin Municipality, Koh Kong Province.
Police said that the perpetrator was a military trainer with a gun in his hand, so the police surrounded for more than an hour and used the consolation rules for the perpetrator to confess to the police to be arrested for legal questioning. Way.
According to the revelations from the neighbors, the shooting and the shooting were caused by jealousy because the victim loved the suspect.
