(Pursat): Due to the power of drugs, a baby animal decided to hit his mother on the head with Angre until he died when he was sent to the emergency room at Pursat Referral Hospital.
The incident happened at 7:40 pm on December 10, 2020 at the victim's house in the village through Sangkat Roleap, Pursat City, Pursat Province.
According to the police, the perpetrator, Yim Simimex, 24, a laborer living in the commune, used a 0.25-centimeter-long anvil to beat his mother, Chan Kimheng, a 48-year-old female living together. The head died on arrival at the hospital and the suspect tried to escape.
