Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh Participates in the 14th ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting via Video
At the meeting, ASEAN member states signed the ASEAN Defense Plan 2020-2023 and drafted a document on regional security stability, focusing on five topics:
First, the procedures for the implementation of the work of the ASEAN Reserve Force in humanitarian and disaster relief.
Second, the procedure for exchanging terrorist information.
Third, the principle of using the flags of ASEAN and the flags of member countries in peacekeeping missions with the United Nations to show the solidarity of ASEAN countries on the international stage.
Fourth, the procedure for linking the ASEAN Defense Ministers' Meeting and the ASEAN Commander-in-Chief Meeting to strengthen military cooperation.
